# Solana keypairs — matched by filename, not by extension, so config
# JSON (package.json, tsconfig.json, biome.json, turbo.json, ...) is
# tracked normally. Program keypairs under target/ are already covered
# by the target/ rule above.
id.json
*-keypair.json
keypair.json
wallet*.json
.config/solana/

.DS_Store
*.log